    "long_instructions": "Use PAIR Programming with AI to  help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n### 🗓️ Keep it Fresh\r\n**Status:** Cleanup Routine\r\n\r\n**Details:** The humidity level dropped throughout the day. The \"Anti-Frizz Tip\" is old news.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Remove the very first post from your schedule using *shift()*. The post that was on Tuesday will automatically slide over to fill the Monday slot.\r\n",
